<p class="patterns-lead">Seeded backgrounds and generative art, drawn as SVG on the server - each
pattern a file of <code>pad/subs/patterns/types/</code> in the engine, written
<code>{open/}pattern 'name'/{close/}</code> or <code>{open/}pattern:name/{close/}</code>. The same
seed gives the same picture, byte for byte; another seed another picture. With
<code>as='url'</code> a pattern is a CSS <code>url()</code> for a style attribute.</p>

<ul class="patterns-cards">
  {patterns}
  <li><a class="patterns-card" href="?{$kind}"><span class="patterns-swatch">{pattern $kind, width=320, height=120/}</span><b>{$name}</b><span>{$line}</span><code>{open/}pattern '{$kind}'/{close/}</code></a></li>
  {/patterns}
</ul>
